<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/jpeg" href="/images/logo.jpg">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Privacy Policy - New Heels</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.0/font/bootstrap-icons.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="/css/style.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { background: #F8F3EF; }
        .page-header { padding: 60px 0 30px; text-align: center; }
        .page-header h1 { color: #3F3040; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .page-header p { color: #8B6688; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .policy-card { background: white; padding: 50px; border-top: 4px solid #C9A45C; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 60px; box-shadow: 0 5px 30px rgba(63, 48, 64, 0.05); }
        .policy-card h3 { color: #3F3040; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #F8F3EF; }
        .policy-card h3:first-of-type { margin-top: 0; }
        .policy-card p, .policy-card li { color: #5a4a5c; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .policy-card ul { padding-left: 20px; }
        .policy-card strong { color: #8B6688; }
        @media (max-width: 768px) { .policy-card { padding: 30px 20px; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <div class="page-header">
        <div class="container">
            <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p>Your Privacy Matters</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="policy-card">
            <h3>Information We Collect</h3>
            <p>When you place an order, we collect:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Personal Info:</strong> Name, phone number, email</li>
                <li><strong>Address:</strong> Delivery address, city, postal code</li>
                <li><strong>Order Info:</strong> Products ordered, quantities, payment method</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>How We Use Your Information</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Process and deliver your orders</li>
                <li>Send order confirmations and updates</li>
                <li>Respond to your inquiries</li>
                <li>Send promotional emails (if subscribed)</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Data Protection</h3>
            <p>Your personal information is protected using industry-standard security measures. We do not share, sell, or trade your data with third parties except:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Delivery partners (to fulfill your order)</li>
                <li>Payment processors (for transactions)</li>
                <li>Legal requirements (if required by law)</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Cookies</h3>
            <p>We use cookies to keep you logged in and remember your cart. You can disable cookies in your browser settings.</p>

            <h3>Newsletter</h3>
            <p>If you subscribe to our newsletter, we'll send you occasional updates. You can unsubscribe anytime.</p>

            <h3>Your Rights</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Access your personal data</li>
                <li>Request correction of your data</li>
                <li>Request deletion of your account</li>
                <li>Opt-out of marketing communications</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Third-Party Services</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Cloudinary:</strong> Image hosting</li>
                <li><strong>Resend:</strong> Email delivery</li>
                <li><strong>MongoDB Atlas:</strong> Secure data storage</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Contact Us</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Email:</strong> newheelsmardan@gmail.com</li>
                <li><strong>WhatsApp:</strong> 0327 7985292</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>